index 0000000000000..521e5231d0e7e
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/whats_new/upcoming_changes/sklearn.neighbors/34187.efficiency.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+* :class:`sklearn.neighbors.KNeighborsClassifier` is now faster when running with multiple threads. The statistics returned from :class:`sklearn.neighbors.BallTree` and :class:`sklearn.neighbors.KDTree` no longer reset on each query, and are no longer incorrect when the tree is used from multiple threads.
